Run main.py to replicate all the results together (panels -> matching -> figures -> R tables).

Inputs: preprocessing/data/03_output/*.parquet (produced by preprocessing/master.py).
Glossary of samples, groups and measures: ../CONTEXT.md. Design decisions: ../docs/adr/.

To replicate step by step:
  python src/d00_preprocessing/gathering.py   -> data/{daily,intraday}_{main,balanced}.parquet
  python src/d00_preprocessing/matching.py    -> data/psm_assignments.parquet (matched_group, eb_weight), data/psm_balance.csv
  python src/d01_figures/daily.py             -> output/figures/daily/{main,balanced}/{full,matched,eb}/
  python src/d01_figures/intraday.py          -> output/figures|tables/intraday/{main,balanced}/{full,matched,eb}/
  python src/d01_figures/intraday_overnight.py-> output/figures|tables/overnight/...
  python src/d01_figures/descriptives.py      -> output/figures|tables/map/{main,balanced}/{full,matched}/ (+ firms_by_country.tex)
  python src/d03_docs/build_sampling_docs.py  -> output/tables/{sample_selection,currencies,matching/balance}.tex (longtable for the long ones),
                                                 ../docs/paper/sampling/{data_section,formulas_appendix}.tex, ../docs/paper/notes/filtering.md
  (figures carry no titles: the folder says sample and group; copy figures/tables into docs/paper by hand
   when compiling the manuscript; output/sampling/sampling_log.csv is the selection funnel)
  Rscript src/d02_results/daily.R             (set SAMPLE <- "main" or "balanced" at the top)
  Rscript src/d02_results/intraday.R
  Rscript src/d02_results/descriptives.R

R: system R >= 4.4; run `Rscript R/requirements.R` once to install the packages (arrow, data.table, fixest, plm, ...).
Python: conda env from ../environment.yml.

Tested on Sep 3, 2026 - MacBook Pro M4 Max, 32GB, macOS 26.1, R 4.5.3, Python 3.10.
